{"title":"The beige-ification of Pride","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-beigeification-of-pride","date":1750262298000,"content":"<p>For years, Pride month meant rainbows in storefronts, on sneakers, burger wrappers, and an endless array of t-shirts and merch. But this June, After a decade of cashing in on queer identity, corporations are pulling back. From the aisles of Target to the Instagram feeds of big brands, the rainbow logos are gone and the merch shelves are empty.</p><p>Podcaster and cultural critic Matt Bernstein <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y-5KecBMVDc\">joined my podcast this week</a> to talk about the rise and fall of rainbow capitalism, the history of the commodification of queer identity, and why this year everything has gone so <em>beige</em>.</p><p>Also, in light of Pride month I want to ask you to <strong>give any small amount you can to <a href=\"https://secure.givelively.org/donate/point-of-pride/taylor-lorenz-s-pride-2025-fundraiser-for-point-of-pride\">Point of Pride</a>,</strong> (truly no amount is too small)! Point of Pride is a trans-led nonprofit that makes gender-affirming care more accessible for the trans and gender diverse community. </p><p>The organization <a href=\"https://secure.givelively.org/donate/point-of-pride/taylor-lorenz-s-pride-2025-fundraiser-for-point-of-pride\">directly helps trans people</a> obtain things like financial aid for surgery, electrolysis, HRT or free binders and shape wear. Since 2016, Point of Pride has helped more than <strong>29,000 trans people in all 50 states </strong>get the care they need and deserve.</p><p>Trans people are finding it harder and harder to access crucial, life saving gender care right now. When you donate to Point of Pride your money goes directly to funding these efforts and helping to build a future filled with safety, joy, and possibility for all trans people. </p><p><strong>Please</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://secure.givelively.org/donate/point-of-pride/taylor-lorenz-s-pride-2025-fundraiser-for-point-of-pride\">donate today</a></strong>, every single dollar counts!! </p><p><a href=\"https://secure.givelively.org/donate/point-of-pride/taylor-lorenz-s-pride-2025-fundraiser-for-point-of-pride\"><span>Donate to Point of Pride</span></a></p><div><div></div></div><div><div><div><p>User Mag is a 100% reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, become a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><h2>What I’m reading</h2><div></div><p><strong>Abolishing ICE Is the Bare Minimum</strong> </p><p>ICE agents aren’t out of control. They are performing their designed role as fascism’s storm troopers. - <em><a href=\"https://www.thenation.com/article/politics/abolish-ice-brad-lander/\">The Nation</a></em></p><p><strong>A.I. Is Poised to Rewrite History. Literally.</strong></p><p>The technology’s ability to read and summarize text is already making it a useful tool for scholarship. How will it change the stories we tell about the past? - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/16/magazine/ai-history-historians-scholarship.html\">The New York Times</a></em></p><p><strong>Is Sabrina Carpenter Selling Out or Trolling the Culture War?</strong></p><p>Let’s talk about the album cover that made the internet implode.- <em><a href=\"https://kimberlynicolefoster.co/p/is-sabrina-carpenter-selling-out?utm_campaign=post\">Kimberly Nicole Foster</a></em></p><p><strong>Tallying the True Costs of AI</strong></p><p>Lots of estimates are floating around about the environmental impact of data centers. Business Insider got the receipts –<a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-data-center-cost-2025-6\"> </a><em><a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-data-center-cost-2025-6\">Business Insider</a></em></p><p><strong>Pablo Torre Won’t Stop Talking</strong></p><p>The podcaster’s obsession with Bill Belichick and Jordon Hudson annoys his critics. He’s not mad about the publicity – <em><a href=\"https://archive.is/2025.06.17-112127/https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/pablo-torre-finds-out-bill-belichick-jordon-hudson-draftkings.html\">New York Magazine</a></em></p><p><strong>Fatigue Can Shatter a Person</strong></p><p>Everyday tiredness is nothing like the depleting symptom that people with long COVID and ME/CFS experience. - <em><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/health/archive/2023/07/chronic-fatigue-long-covid-symptoms/674834/?gift=S_mMEA_KE0kfem_P5v81NuNq9zdHUFNuhj-SKzZuoko&amp;utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_campaign=social\">The Atlantic</a></em></p><p><strong>How NYT Magazine Threw Away Journalistic Ethics on Suicide</strong></p><p>The New York Times violated almost all of the published guidelines by personalizing, detailing, dramatizing, justifying and sentimentalizing a suicide. - <em><a href=\"https://fair.org/home/how-nyt-magazine-threw-away-journalistic-ethics-on-suicide/\">Fairness &amp; Accuracy in Reporting</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-beigeification-of-pride?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY2MTE0MjI0LCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.iWWFTCIJEQyxaHW7Jp9XnOcWpfUM4CPXvcN46hfVaRM\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown </h2><ul><li><p>On Monday I <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/kids-are-protesting-ice-raids-in-roblox-brookhaven\">reported on anti-ICE protests taking over Roblox</a>. One of the kids I interviewed texted me this morning to share that the Roblox protesters are now facing police violence:</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zF3I!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2b1addb-0f3a-4dab-9e75-d2d1e8f14dd7_1179x808.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zF3I!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2b1addb-0f3a-4dab-9e75-d2d1e8f14dd7_1179x808.jpeg\" width=\"354\" height=\"242.60559796437659\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zF3I!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2b1addb-0f3a-4dab-9e75-d2d1e8f14dd7_1179x808.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zF3I!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2b1addb-0f3a-4dab-9e75-d2d1e8f14dd7_1179x808.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zF3I!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2b1addb-0f3a-4dab-9e75-d2d1e8f14dd7_1179x808.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zF3I!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2b1addb-0f3a-4dab-9e75-d2d1e8f14dd7_1179x808.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>NBA superstars <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/twitch/nba-superstars-want-to-become-streamers-as-they-make-more-money-3216131/\">want to become Twitch streamers</a> as they say creators make more money than they do.</p></li><li><p>Man unable to sleep when his <a href=\"https://futurism.com/man-sleep-ai-mattress-outage\">AI-controlled</a> mattress suffers an outage.</p></li><li><p>\"xAI is burning $1 billion a month so Grok can explain <a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@drewharwell/post/DLBjeZvNQsn\">white-supremacist</a> conspiracy theories in the style of Jar-Jar Binks\".</p></li><li><p>A new gadget called the ‘Dream Recorder’ says it can <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/new-ai-device-records-your-dreams-by-turning-them-into-videos-3215989/\">use AI to turn your dreams</a> into shareable videos.</p></li><li><p>More people are putting on <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/workplace/how-people-decided-its-ok-to-wear-airpods-anywhere-anytime-34823672\">airpods</a> and never taking them off.</p></li><li><p>A muted, slightly dusty pale pink dubbed “CEO Pink” <a href=\"https://archive.ph/aFNbq#selection-699.27-699.60\">is the new power neutral</a>, according to WSJ.</p></li><li><p>Logan Paul said he is <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/youtube/logan-paul-still-considering-presidential-run-but-says-mrbeast-would-be-better-3216002/\">considering presidential run</a> when he comes of age, but says MrBeast would be better.</p></li><li><p>The NYT is desperately trying to compete with TikTok by putting giant vertical videos of their reporters on its homepage:</p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!R7u3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8972aa7c-cafe-4965-afbf-6c0ffe53ae0a_1075x904.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!R7u3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8972aa7c-cafe-4965-afbf-6c0ffe53ae0a_1075x904.jpeg\" width=\"409\" height=\"343.9404651162791\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!R7u3!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8972aa7c-cafe-4965-afbf-6c0ffe53ae0a_1075x904.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!R7u3!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8972aa7c-cafe-4965-afbf-6c0ffe53ae0a_1075x904.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!R7u3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8972aa7c-cafe-4965-afbf-6c0ffe53ae0a_1075x904.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!R7u3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8972aa7c-cafe-4965-afbf-6c0ffe53ae0a_1075x904.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><ul><li><p>For the first time, social media <a href=\"https://www.niemanlab.org/2025/06/for-the-first-time-social-media-overtakes-tv-as-americans-top-news-source/\">has overtaken TV</a> as Americans’ top news source.</p></li><li><p>Tucker Carlson <a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@keithedwards/post/DLBj_f2AY9V\">remembered how to do journalism</a> for a brief moment in his interview with Ted Cruz. </p></li><li><p>Scientists once hoarded pre-nuclear steel, and <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2025/06/why-one-man-is-archiving-human-made-content-from-before-the-ai-explosion/\">now we’re hoarding pre-AI content</a>.</p></li><li><p>Capri-Sun launches incredibly long 15-inch juice pouch that’s <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/food/capri-sun-launches-incredibly-long-15-inch-juice-pouch-that-immediately-sold-out-3215915/\">already $100 on Ebay</a>.</p></li><li><p>The Law &amp; Crime network is making an <a href=\"https://x.com/jayshams/status/1935114289972691234?s=46&amp;t=qjmdupmcsZXWJHQY5AyzUQ\">AI-generated recreation of Diddy trial </a>testimony using the official court transcript.</p></li><li><p>Jerry Gogosian, an IG meme account known for its acerbic commentary on the art world, <a href=\"https://www.artnews.com/art-news/news/jerry-gogosian-winds-down-instagram-hilde-lynn-helphenstein-1234744817/\">is shutting down</a>.</p></li><li><p>The <a href=\"https://archive.ph/Uh2D7\">subtle art</a> of the dad text.</p></li><li><p>The Dallas Cowboys cheerleaders got a <a href=\"https://archive.ph/yAWQp\">400% pay</a> raise.</p></li><li><p>The NYT attempts to explain <a href=\"https://archive.ph/O2o2Y\">crashing</a> out.</p></li><li><p>Work meetings after 8pm have <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/workplace/more-workers-are-putting-in-extra-hours-after-the-workday-fb6b57aa\">become 16% more frequent</a> in the US.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3K8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F231c923e-ae14-4f89-826e-9119e640d74f_1566x328.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3K8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F231c923e-ae14-4f89-826e-9119e640d74f_1566x328.png\" width=\"574\" height=\"120.24038461538461\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3K8!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F231c923e-ae14-4f89-826e-9119e640d74f_1566x328.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3K8!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F231c923e-ae14-4f89-826e-9119e640d74f_1566x328.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3K8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F231c923e-ae14-4f89-826e-9119e640d74f_1566x328.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3K8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F231c923e-ae14-4f89-826e-9119e640d74f_1566x328.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Toy Story 5 is <a href=\"https://gizmodo.com/toy-story-5-is-making-tech-its-big-bad-2000615542?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email\">making tech its big bad enemy</a>. </p></li><li><p>OpenAI won a <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2025/06/16/openai-wins-200-million-us-defense-contract.html\">$200M contract</a> with the US Department of Defense.</p></li><li><p>Meanwhile the Department of Defense has made four tech executives from Palantir, Meta and OpenAI <a href=\"https://gizmodo.com/silicon-valley-execs-join-the-army-as-officers-but-wont-have-to-attend-boot-camp-2000617223\">officers in the U.S. Army.</a></p></li><li><p>AI-generated <a href=\"https://x.com/dexerto/status/1934668684389134435?s=46&amp;t=qjmdupmcsZXWJHQY5AyzUQ\">ASMR</a> videos are now going viral on YouTube Shorts and Reels.</p></li><li><p>Meta is making <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DK9lwLpuiqZ/\">smart glasses</a> with Oakley.</p></li><li><p>Josh Kushner had his <a href=\"https://pagesix.com/2025/06/15/celebrity-news/josh-kushner-hosts-star-studded-40th-birthday-bash-at-famed-katzs-deli-in-nyc-with-jared-ivanka-trump-stopping-by\">40th birthday party</a> at Katz’s Deli.</p></li><li><p>Researchers say the U.S. now has all three <a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/politics/archive/2025/06/in-minnesota-americas-luck-ran-out/683194/?gift=I4z9bpSIcQg4ORf-CqRntp726Xp7IYzwMlRbnz4RCZk&amp;utm_source=copy-link&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_campaign=share\">key conditions</a> for political violence.</p></li><li><p>The<a href=\"https://x.com/willsommer/status/1934781996472869031\"> neo-Nazi crypto community</a> is imploding over memecoin drama and allegations of a scam between former allies.</p></li><li><p>A group of Canadians is lobbying to make the province of Alberta the<a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2025/06/16/trump-canada-51st-state-backers\"> 51st U.S. state</a>.</p></li><li><p>Private space stations are racing to become the <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/science/space-astronomy/private-space-stations-tourism-52bfc0d3\">next ‘it’ destination</a> as commercial space projects hope to attract tourists.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZbbX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F543a67a2-bdf7-459a-8242-cbd0c0371ad6_1134x236.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZbbX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F543a67a2-bdf7-459a-8242-cbd0c0371ad6_1134x236.png\" width=\"528\" height=\"109.88359788359789\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZbbX!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F543a67a2-bdf7-459a-8242-cbd0c0371ad6_1134x236.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZbbX!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F543a67a2-bdf7-459a-8242-cbd0c0371ad6_1134x236.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZbbX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F543a67a2-bdf7-459a-8242-cbd0c0371ad6_1134x236.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZbbX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F543a67a2-bdf7-459a-8242-cbd0c0371ad6_1134x236.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Substack is <a href=\"https://www.newcomer.co/p/scoop-substack-in-talks-to-raise\">pitching investors</a> on a round between $50M and $100M, and considering helping writers sell ads.</p></li><li><p>Influencer <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/influencer-calls-police-on-husband-for-making-her-do-chores-instead-of-creating-content-3216007/\">called the police on her husband</a> for making her do chores instead of creating content.</p></li><li><p>Thousands of Nintendo Switch 2 <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/gaming/thousands-of-nintendo-switch-2-consoles-stolen-in-1-4-million-truck-heist-3216115/\">consoles were stolen</a> in a $1.4 million truck heist.</p></li><li><p>Soleil Ho, former food-critic at the San Francisco chronicle is <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DK-wzvfSVBz\">launching their own independent news outlet: Coyote.</a> </p></li><li><p>Robot-run <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/venhub-robot-convenience-store\">bodegas</a> are taking over L.A.</p></li><li><p>Twitch star Ninja believes AI will kill streaming unless drastic measures are taken to <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/twitch/ninja-warns-ai-will-make-streaming-impossible-in-just-one-year-3216016/\">filter out real and fake clips</a>.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DK98s9Xux8g/\">An IG video tour</a> of Trump-supporting livestreamer Adin Ross’ new $25.5M Florida mansion. </p></li><li><p>Threads is adding <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/688267/threads-fediverse-feed-search\">fediverse</a> content to your social feeds.</p></li><li><p>HBO Max will soon show autoplaying <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/688313/max-video-previews-autoplay-update\">video previews</a> suggested by AI.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lXMi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd6278499-20f6-4437-9872-bbf125f98d1e_1238x242.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lXMi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd6278499-20f6-4437-9872-bbf125f98d1e_1238x242.png\" width=\"1238\" height=\"242\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lXMi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd6278499-20f6-4437-9872-bbf125f98d1e_1238x242.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lXMi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd6278499-20f6-4437-9872-bbf125f98d1e_1238x242.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lXMi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd6278499-20f6-4437-9872-bbf125f98d1e_1238x242.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lXMi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd6278499-20f6-4437-9872-bbf125f98d1e_1238x242.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>ICE and local police quietly shared surveillance data in a casual alliance, according to <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/emails-reveal-the-casual-surveillance-alliance-between-ice-and-local-police/\">leaked emails</a>.</p></li><li><p>Americans now watch <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/17/business/media/streaming-beats-cable-broadcast.html?unlocked_article_code=1.Pk8.iLxL.MXfJEMlel9VJ&amp;smid=url-share\">more TV</a> on streaming than on cable and broadcast networks combined.</p></li><li><p>Walmart plans to leverage its $2.3B <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-06-17/walmart-wmt-pushes-toward-shoppable-tv-experience-with-vizio-deal\">Vizio acquisition</a> to push shoppable TV experiences.</p></li><li><p>Facebook announces that all videos on <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/06/17/facebook-announces-that-all-videos-on-its-platform-will-soon-be-shared-as-reels/\">its platform</a> will soon be shared as reels.</p></li><li><p>The <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/687721/the-atlantic-games-hub-bracket-city\">Atlantic</a> is making a big push into games.</p></li><li><p>Trump will grant TikTok another 90-day extension in enforcement of <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/06/17/tech/tiktok-trump-ban-delay\">sale-or-ban</a> law.</p></li><li><p>Sam Altman says Meta tried and failed to poach <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/06/17/sam-altman-says-meta-tried-and-failed-to-poach-openais-talent-with-100m-offers/\">OpenAI’s talent</a> with $100M offers.</p></li><li><p>Amazon expects to cut corporate jobs as it <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/business/business-news/amazon-expects-cut-corporate-jobs-due-to-ai-artificial-intelligence-rcna213552\">relies more</a> on AI.</p></li><li><p>California is trying to <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/688301/california-is-trying-to-regulate-its-ai-giants-again\">regulate its AI</a> giants — again.</p></li><li><p>X is suing the state of New York over a law requiring social media companies to disclose how they deal with hate speech, extremism, and disinformation, claiming it violates the <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-06-17/musk-s-x-sues-new-york-over-law-requiring-hate-speech-disclosure\">US Constitution</a>.</p></li><li><p>The biggest <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/business/the-biggest-companies-across-america-are-cutting-their-workforces-a0e8739a\">companies</a> across America are cutting their workforces.</p></li><li><p>$4,785., that’s how much it costs to be a <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/16/opinion/sports-nba-mlb-leagues-streaming-fan.html\">sports fan</a> now.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A-aL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0a145471-a402-4e75-b810-7c8c747fa5ed_1228x462.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A-aL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0a145471-a402-4e75-b810-7c8c747fa5ed_1228x462.png\" width=\"622\" height=\"234.0097719869707\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A-aL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0a145471-a402-4e75-b810-7c8c747fa5ed_1228x462.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A-aL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0a145471-a402-4e75-b810-7c8c747fa5ed_1228x462.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A-aL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0a145471-a402-4e75-b810-7c8c747fa5ed_1228x462.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A-aL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0a145471-a402-4e75-b810-7c8c747fa5ed_1228x462.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>Best Buy will host a weeklong <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/best-buy-black-friday-in-july-sale-prime-day-2025\">'Black Friday in July'</a> sale to compete with Prime day.</p></li><li><p>A new TikTok trend features women protecting soft-spoken boyfriends <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/tiktok-trend-men-boyfriends-showing-interests-plants\">showing off</a> their special interests.</p></li><li><p>'Grow a Garden?' is <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/roblox-grow-garden-farming-simulator-farmville\">The Roblox</a> farming simulator is exploding in popularity.</p></li><li><p>AI adoption has <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/ai-use-among-workers-40-percent-stat\">reached 40%</a> among U.S. workers.</p></li><li><p>Mattel announces plans to <a href=\"https://futurism.com/mattel-announces-openai\">incorporate AI</a> into children's toys.</p></li><li><p>A far right \"<a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/far-right-appeal-to-heaven-flag-sba-government-agency-dc/\">appeal to heaven</a>\" flag is currently flying over a U.S. government building.</p></li><li><p>Deloitte is fighting employee burnout with Legos, experts say the real way to <a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91353152/deloitte-is-fighting-employee-burnout-with-legos\">fight burnout</a> is time off.</p></li><li><p>Netflix is opening its first two <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/687830/netflix-house-venue-dallas-philadelphia-las-vegas-open-late-2025\">Netflix House</a> (their own theme park) in late 2025 and the third one in 2027.</p></li><li><p>ProPublica has <a href=\"https://www.propublica.org/article/propublica-fda-lawsuit-drug-safety\">sued the FDA</a>, accusing the agency of withholding information about the safety and availability of generic drugs critical to millions of Americans.</p></li></ul><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!k0kB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b26e601-671b-46a3-8f6e-60716b43365f_1066x164.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!k0kB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b26e601-671b-46a3-8f6e-60716b43365f_1066x164.png\" width=\"1066\" height=\"164\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!k0kB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b26e601-671b-46a3-8f6e-60716b43365f_1066x164.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!k0kB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b26e601-671b-46a3-8f6e-60716b43365f_1066x164.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!k0kB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4b26e601-671b-46a3-8f6e-60716b43365f_1066x164.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!k0kB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubs